Subject: [PATCH v7 08/12] platform/x86/intel/pmt: decouple sysfs and namespace
Date: Wed,  9 Jul 2025 14:44:54 -0400
Message-ID: <20250709184458.298283-9-michael.j.ruhl@intel.com>
